          },
          "description": "**What it measures:** Count of error responses by HTTP status code in each interval.\n\nUses `increase()` to show the actual number of errors rather than a rate.\n\n**Click any line to drill into the Error Endpoint Drilldown table.**",
          "interval": "1m"
        }
      ]
